Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:07.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But why him, of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:13.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,What was Father thinking, giving that man\Nof unknown lineage the Black Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:18.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was from when Father was an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:20.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,He pushed into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,the deepest corner of the Dungeon\Nof the Lost with the Sovereign Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:29.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was a long and dangerous quest\Nthat yielded a prime dungeon relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That blade is made of\Nan unknown material,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,harder than mythril,\Norichalcum, and mana-metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter the technique or skill used,\Nnothing will cause even a scratch on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's otherwise known as\Nthe "Unbreakable Blade."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.79,0:00:53.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The biggest question is, how has such\Na resilient material gotten so beat up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:58.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That sword has value\Nbeyond that of a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.13,0:01:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,To casually just let that sword go...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.71,0:01:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:05.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about this wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:10.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Father has also noticed the sense\Nof unrest hanging over this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.96,0:01:14.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,In all likelihood,\NFather is counting on that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That man who defeated a minotaur\Nand saved Lynne's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:27.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,He can be a secret weapon\Nfor a "something"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,that will happen in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.29,0:01:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Actually, Lynne...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it okay for you to be seen out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.79,0:01:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes. Right now, I am first\Nand foremost an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.67,0:01:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of going to\Nthe guild after eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds good, Instructor Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm really not someone who should be\Nconsidered an instructor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:56.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,but the more I try to\Nclear up the misunderstanding
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:01:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,the more complicated this situation gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.25,0:02:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,And she's following me everywhere\Nlike it's a normal thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:06.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll get some work from the guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,and eventually she'll be able to grasp\Nhow simple of a person I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope you find a good task, Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.79,0:02:17.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:49.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:53.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you with Lady Lynneburg?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:54.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,As an adventurer, my name is Lynne.\NNo need to add any titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, my apologies, Lynne.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something happen again yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:07.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:11.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's really difficult to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's fine, one of the rules here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,is to not stick your nose\Nin other people's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forget I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, but I wanted\Nto get some advice though...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.75,0:04:24.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, what brings you here today?\NLooking for work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:28.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,One two people can do, if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:30.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,A two-person job, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I believe you're a silver B-rank, Lynne?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:37.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you two form a party,\Nyou can at least take on
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:44.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,the goblin hunting job\Nin the outskirts of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:46.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,G-gob...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Goblin hunting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Goblins are those monsters that\Nadventurers the world over use
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,to put their skills to the test!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir, can we really take on that task?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:59.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:05:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne can accept silver tasks on her own,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,but bringing along a partner with\Na lower rank than hers is a liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:10.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Normally, the job\Ndrops down a rank or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will this work out?\NA quest outside the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doesn't this mean I'm taking\Nadvantage of Lynne's adventurer rank?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,And to think,\Nup until now all I wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:24.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,was for her to go back home\Nas soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:30.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She sees right through me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,How self-absorbed of me.\NI'm ashamed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:38.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would Lynne seriously\Nform a party with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:40.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,U-um, are you okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm relying on your rank\Nto take this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm okay with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can do for you,\NInstructor, just say the word!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:56.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:06:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel pitiful depending on\Nsuch a young girl for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,one of my dreams is coming true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:09.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then let's head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.58,0:06:10.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I haven't told you\Nwhere you're going or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you're gonna take this one, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:23.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,A low threat level\Ndoesn't mean you'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.29,0:06:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know what my limits are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:33.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're going to this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only report what you've caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the Forest of Beasts, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The right ear will be\Nthe proof of your successful hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.75,0:06:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can't get compensated without it,\Nso make sure you bring it back with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The right ear, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, there've been reports lately of\Ntheir numbers decreasing by a good amount,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,so if not one of them shows itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:56.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,pick some medicinal herbs or something\Nand bring those back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:06:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:06:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I'm serious,\Nbe careful not to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:10.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:22.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's get to it, Lynne.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:30.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,So this is the Forest of Beasts, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:32.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The trees are pretty dense here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,These are a different type of tree than\Nthe kind I see in the southern forests.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The ecology is a little different here\Nthan in other places.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:52.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne, what kind of creatures are goblins?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:53.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:55.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'd like to\Nhear about them beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:01.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Normally, they hunt small animals\Nas prey and eat the fruits off the trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,but they've been aggressively\Nattacking humans for sustenance too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:09.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we leave them be their numbers may grow\Ntoo much it could lead to a food shortage,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:11.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,and then they could overflow\Ninto human villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why adventurers\Nare regularly hunting them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,and controlling their numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Controlling them...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's said that the abundance\Nof the ecological system of the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,depends on whether or not\Nthere are goblins there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:26.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,so it's not good to hunt them\Nto extinction either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Actually, this forest also has\Nrare flora and fauna you can see
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,that are not found in other places,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,so it's also used as a training ground
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,and a place to gain income\Nfor beginner adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.71,0:08:43.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not only does Lynne have the skills,\Nbut she also has extensive knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's hardly anything I can teach her...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,None here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,How about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Under normal circumstances,\Nwe would have already encountered them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:17.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems the rumors about\Nthe goblin numbers dwindling are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:22.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a response\Nfrom a monster-like thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a little far, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem like it'll take much time\Nto get there, so let's go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It keeps getting darker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of very old trees\Naround this part,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.29,0:09:40.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and it's hard for the sun\Nto shine through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:44.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Goblins seem to prefer a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:53.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The presence of a monster was up ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:55.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,but it's disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:56.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Monsters are living things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can't they die from illness or old age?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:08.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is definitely a possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's... nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:32.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uncover!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.25,0:10:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:51.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a goblin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a goblin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's way bigger than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're said to be the weakest,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,but there's a huge difference\Nin hearing about it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:10.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,and having one right in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:14.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But those features check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:19.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Green skin, walking on two legs,\Npiercing, beast-like eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,And they use tools!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do all adventurers handle these guys\Nlike they're nothing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course she's freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:38.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Although she's blessed with abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,she still has very little\Nactual combat experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:45.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be scared of, Lynne.\NWe're only up against a goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I can't think about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:00.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:05.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uncover!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the... Goblin Em-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.17,0:12:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Goblin Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.21,0:12:26.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,A subspecies of the Goblin King\Nthat is considered an extreme threat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Goblin Emperor is a monster created\Nfrom genetic manipulation by man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The deviant research that brought forth\Nthis forbidden knowledge is now banned!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,On top of that,\Nthis one eats its own kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.17,0:12:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,then ingests that power\Nand grows stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:45.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be scared of, Lynne.\NWe're only up against a goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:51.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did he come here because he sensed it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The reason he acted so excited\Nto take on this job
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:58.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,was because he wanted to eliminate\Nthis threat no one knew about!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm not alone right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:19.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Trying to corner me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:38.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.67,0:13:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Windcutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Icicle Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.29,0:13:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't think it could be so quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:02.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.67,0:14:07.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:09.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,In front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry! Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry! Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.33,0:14:28.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's the wound?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even Goblin Emperors\Nshouldn't be able to recover that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The mana-stone on its forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you can get that off,\Nwe just might beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way, was he watching\Nhow many I could parry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't block them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:57.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Windblast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.17,0:15:09.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's just as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's constantly replenishing\Nits power with the mana-stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we're just going\Nto run out of stamina and magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:33.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, if your magic attacks can't hit him,\Nthen nothing I can do will work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:37.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne, can you aim that at my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:39.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aim it to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mean Windblast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:41.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That move is powerful enough\Nto demolish castle walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.71,0:15:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong you are,\NInstructor, it-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It won't hit me directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,This sword can withstand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think the only chance we've got\Nis to go faster than him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:05.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:11.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.75,0:16:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Windblast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:22.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Physical Enhancement!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Featherstep!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:30.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,My body!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.83,0:16:31.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Low Heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:03.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:05.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's the mana-stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:13.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne, will you finish it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but can you make sure\Nit doesn't suffer much?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell Flare!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.71,0:18:07.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna refrain from anymore\Ngoblin slaying for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:14.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't get overconfident\Nand go into dangerous situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:19.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll take on the next challenge\Nafter I've trained more
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,and gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,So it was a Goblin Emperor this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:39.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can hardly fathom how powerful it was\Nwith this pure of a mana-stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:43.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,According to the reports, it was\Nseveral times the size of a Goblin King.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.67,0:18:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something like this is abnormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Magical Empire may be responsible\Nfor the incident itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But this mana-stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We think it could be a Demon's Heart\Nfrom the Holy Theocracy of Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,How is Lynne?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:03.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only minor wounds, miraculously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:06.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Must have been a hard battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's amazing they were able\Nto overcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The monster hid itself\Nbehind a powerful seal
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.29,0:19:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,and ambushed them\Nin the Forest of Beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:20.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg believes it had been there\Nfor a few days, maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And this seal is one such that not even\Nthe Secret Corps can perceive it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But how were they carrying\Nsuch a bulky thing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,all the way to this country\Nin the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,If it was summoning magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,the sensory network in the capital\Nshould have caught it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Were there no telltale signs\Nin the perimeter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:41.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The number of goblins was decreasing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,so the adventurer's guild has been\Nrequesting an investigation into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:49.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,There may have been several\Nsimilar cases in other areas as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,This report is a summary of questionable\Ninstances from the last three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:19:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:00.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Continue on with the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:07.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, never thought that little runt from\Nback then would grow up to slay goblins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was way harder\Nthan I imagined it'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne saved the day,\Nand we managed to get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:17.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that isn't true!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,All the same, I should celebrate\Nmy first day hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It may be a minor thing\Nto other adventurers,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,but to me this is a huge step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:35.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, you just watched\Non the sidelines, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess that's the wiser choice, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.58,0:20:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I just helped out a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have no idea where I'd be now\Nif Lynne hadn't been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:49.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'M the one that only helped\NYOU out a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.63,0:20:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, even goblins\Nare still a threat to newbies,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,so it was good experience, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.83,0:20:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Until I saw them in real life,\NI had no idea goblins were like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.21,0:21:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,and I hadn't even thought about the stone\Non its forehead being a weak point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:09.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,A stone on the forehead?\NWhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was a reddish color,\Nand a pretty stone at that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean the mana-stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's normally buried in the heart\Nor the throat, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:23.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure that was really a goblin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really do think it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.54,0:21:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,If that's what you say it is, Instructor,\Nthen it's a goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter what anyone says!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Might've been a rare type, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, show me the proof of the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you your cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The right ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:49.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I told you to remember to bring it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.75,0:21:53.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.17,0:21:57.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We burnt the goblin up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:21:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,To ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:00.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:10.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,#4 I Parry a Goblin
